# "Curiosity killed the cat" - Russell & Norvig, AIMA 3rd ed., Section 9.5.3.
#
# Jack owns a dog. Every dog owner is an animal lover. No animal lover kills
# an animal. Either Jack or Curiosity killed the cat, who is named Tuna.
# Did Curiosity kill the cat?
#
# Needs Skolemization (the dog Jack owns has no name) and nested quantifiers.

exists X. (dog(X) & owns(jack, X))
all X. ((exists Y. (dog(Y) & owns(X, Y))) -> animal_lover(X))
all X. (animal_lover(X) -> (all Y. (animal(Y) -> ~kills(X, Y))))
kills(jack, tuna) | kills(curiosity, tuna)
cat(tuna)
all X. (cat(X) -> animal(X))

? kills(curiosity, tuna)
? kills(Who, tuna)
